# Data races ThreadSanitizer reports inside the libraries the engine is built from (suppressions=,
# see run_tests.sh). One line per finding, with why: a race in the engine's own code is fixed,
# never listed here.

# Mbed TLS counts its elliptic curve multiplications in a global (mul_count) for its self-test,
# from every thread doing TLS at once, with no lock; nothing reads it outside the self-test.
race:mbedtls_mpi_mul_mod
